  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "This AIM assembles the per-modality Personal Statuses - Text, Speech, Face, and Gesture - into a single Entity Personal Status. It combines; it does not compute. Each modality input is optional, but at least one shall be present; the Entity Personal Status carries whichever modalities are supplied.",
